From 2fb396c2f4497001be819bdf37a6eef7cb310c9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zach Denton <z@chdenton.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 11:05:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [Loom] Materialize exact encoding configuration reads

Use the encoding fact summary to replace resolved config.get values with encoding.define before executable lowering. Scalar folding remains unchanged and unresolved declarations retain their symbol reads. Cover returned schemas and layouts, unresolved declarations, and packed i4/i8 fragment consumers through source-to-low.
---
